<title>GERMANY: Commerzbank details 96 earnings by division.</title>
<headline>Commerzbank details 96 earnings by division.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Calendar 1996</p>
<p>Commerzbank on Tuesday provided the following breakdown of operating profit by division.</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Group management		 312 loss  vs 324 loss</p>
<p>    Domestic branch banking	185	 vs 476</p>
<p>    International finance	  1,449     vs 1,031</p>
<p>    Investment banking	     537	 vs 263</p>
<p>    Total				1,859     vs 1,446</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German bank is Commerzbank AG.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
